<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<Fleet xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <Name>Gold Wing</Name>
  <Version>3</Version>
  <TotalPoints>3000</TotalPoints>
  <FactionKey>KUIPER/kuiper</FactionKey>
  <Description>Difficulty: &lt;color=green&gt;EASY&lt;/color&gt;

Gold Wing "Heaven Sent" consists of a 50mm/Beam Kasr and a trio of Kyves, two dedicated to point defense and one an anti-jamming boat. Gold Wing's goal in an engagement is to take an area and refuse to let it go. Using the ruggedness of the Kasr and the support network of the Kyves. Following a recent refit, Last to Fall now mounts a constellation of cubesats in a mass launcher for use against missle threats, either in an array of jamming loadouts for soft kill, or loaded with 40mm to suppliment the already strong PD net of the fleet.
  </Description>
  <ModDependencies>
    <unsignedLong>3649434947</unsignedLong>
  </ModDependencies>
  <SortOverrideOrder>3</SortOverrideOrder>
